# Deny everything by default, then explicitly allow only the files
# that make up the published maintenance page. README.md is intentionally
# left out so it stays local-only and never gets committed/published.
*

!.gitignore
!CNAME
!index.html
!assets/
!assets/style.css
!assets/script.js
!assets/logo.svg
!assets/warning.svg
!assets/favicon.ico
!assets/bg.webp
